    "slug": "mr14-counterparty-risk",
    "title": "MR14: Counterparty Credit Risk",
    "content": "# MR14: Counterparty Credit Risk\n\nRisiko kredit yang menari mengikuti pasar: EE/PFE (exposure), CVA/XVA (harga risiko), netting & collateral (perisai), wrong-way risk, SA-CCR.\n\n- EE untuk pricing/CVA; PFE untuk limit; profil swap = punuk\n- CVA = LGD*sum(EE*PD) — bergerak dengan spread sebelum default\n- Netting + collateral bisa mereduksi exposure ~88%\n- Wrong-way risk melipatgandakan kerugian; specific WWR = tolak\n- SA-CCR: EAD = 1.4*(RC + PFE add-on)\n\n*(Lesson interaktif lengkap tersedia di halaman /learn/mr14-counterparty-risk.)*\n"
