    "content": "# MR16: Regulasi — Basel 2.5 & FRTB\n\nEvolusi regulasi modal risiko pasar: Basel 2.5 (stressed VaR, IRC) -> FRTB (boundary ketat, ES 97.5%, liquidity horizon, SBM/IMA, NMRF, PLA).\n\n- Stressed VaR = obat amnesia model\n- FRTB: SBM (sensitivitas) vs IMA (model internal per desk)\n- ES 97.5% + liquidity horizon (10-120 hari) = inti modal\n- IMA lolos 2 ujian: backtest + PLA (Spearman & KS)\n- NMRF: <24 harga real/tahun -> stress charge tanpa diversifikasi\n- Regulasi = arsitektur insentif\n\n*(Lesson interaktif lengkap tersedia di halaman /learn/mr16-regulasi-frtb.)*\n"
